my chronicles, one contemporary, another Dark Ages. In neither cameo was she 4th gen, Sejanus' considerable potency of blood coming from consuming the heart's blood of at least one descendant of Mithras' during his many centuries of almost absolute radio silence holed up somewhere in the British Isles.<br /> <br /> (Extra wtf moment for the DA group in the reveal that Boukhepos was actually a false persona of Sejanus/Vitel)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-02-03T08:05:00-08:00","id":1548142,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1547902-is-vitel-the-antediluvian-lasombra?p=1548115#post1548115\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">little gratuitous aside, but used sybil once or twice in my chronicles, one contemporary, another dark ages. In neither cameo was she 4th gen, sejanus' considerable potency of blood coming from consuming the heart's blood of at least one descendant of mithras' during his many centuries of almost absolute radio silence holed up somewhere in the british isles.<br /> <br /> (extra wtf moment for the da group in the reveal that boukhepos was actually a false persona of sejanus/vitel)</div> </div> </div> </div>*need to know more intensifies*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6350-marcusvitel","name":"MarcusVitel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-02-04T07:15:55-08:00","id":1548187,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MarcusVitel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1547902-is-vitel-the-antediluvian-lasombra?p=1548142#post1548142\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> *need to know more intensifies*</div> </div> </div> </div>Quick explanation - since the introduction of Inconnu monitor <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Maltheas\" target=\"_blank\">Maltheas</a> back in Transylvania Chronicles II and the questions he raises about the generation and character of Veddhartha and Mithras both, i developed something of a taste for idea of kindred elder or methuselahs that, through either ignorance (remember how a number of characters in the clan novels seem to get their precise generation wrong?) of their ancestors' sins or all-too conscious deceit and malice, make claims about their lineage not wholy true when not outright myth-making. The introduction in Giovanni Chronicles II &amp; III of the idea that Lady Anne's 6th gen potency came not through pedigree but furtive acts of diablerie spread across the centuries, only added to my fascination for the idea of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Invented_tradition\" target=\"_blank\">fakelore </a>as something of a recurring theme.<br /> <br /> And as you can guess from all of this, Mithras, the ancient Ventrue who leads a cult <b><i>worshipping him as a sun god</i></b> while also being the prince of London since some point in the middle ages and Vitel, the roman Lasombra methuselah that would pass himself off as a roman Ventrue and <b><i>under such persona assume praxis of the federal capital of the United States</i>,<i> for almost half of a century</i></b>, are pretty much the worst/best of this cavalcade of brazen impostors that have at times rewritten not only their personal stories, but parts of those of their own clans and more with their shenanigans.<br /> <br /> No wonder this duo are pretty much my absolute favorites when it comes to cooking up deep tier Jyhad plotting, introduction of cryptolore or some canon-twisting reveal to shock players with.<br /> <br /> Added bonus, Vitel's backstory mentions in passing how he moved into the British Isles sometime between his embrace but before the fall of Rome (or the roman withdrawal from Britain, for that matter), where he would stay until the coming of the Inquisition and the formation of the Sabbat sparked his interest and renewed involvement into the wars of princes and sect politics.<br /> Meaning that <b><i>for the greater part of one and a half millenium</i></b>, those two glorious bastards (should i mention Tiamat, Magda, Gotsdam, Black Annis &amp; who knows what else were also around...) would call the Isles home - and involve themselves into who knows what kind of convoluted 4-d chess shadow games meanwhile.<br /> <br /> It was all too juicy to simply file and forget once i put all those little pieces together as you can imagine. Now the specifics of the Vitel-related shenanigans of my games, i'll leave for another, longer post. See you soon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 02-04-2025, 11:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":1},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-02-05T11:17:41-08:00","id":1548229,"title":"","content":"We are looking forward to it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}